# The top circles of the holes of screw_pair.tlspr's two plates picked
# with the mouse and made a screw mate; the same as path_mate_screw.go
# makes (TestPathEquivalence/mate_screw).
file $testdata/ui/screw_pair.tlspr
menu File|Open...
key f
move 245 185
down L 245 185
up L 245 185
move 445 195
down L 445 195
up L 445 195
menu Assembly|Mate Screw
